From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:55:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] threadpoolwinrt: asynchronous action states, completion
 handler, IInspectable methods

- the IAsyncAction returned by ThreadPool.RunAsync reports Started, Completed, Error or Canceled, keeps its
  id and error code, runs the Completed handler exactly once (also when it is set after the work finished),
  and implements Cancel (a work item cancelled before it starts is skipped) and Close
- GetIids, GetRuntimeClassName and GetTrustLevel of the action and the factory answer; the todo_wine marks
  in tests/threadpool.c are removed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

